754","id":3532442507,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SjMuL","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-14T12:08:37Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T12:08:37Z","body":"> Text and icons are way to washed off compared to their background, this is by for the most troublesome to me, given my color problem, and also the most present through out the editor. Suggestion here is to slightly lighten the text and icons towards white. I do thing there is quite some margin before it pops off too much and starts to look bad\n\nSome contrast concerns were already addressed in:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112350\n\nBut still needs to be tweaked\n\n---\n\nPoint five might be covered by:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112454","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3532442507/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567822638","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112754#issuecomment-3567822638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112754","id":3567822638,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UqKcu","user":{"login":"KarmyDev","id":32240709,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjQwNzA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32240709?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarmyDev","html_url":"https://github.com/KarmyDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarmyDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarmyDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarmyDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarmyDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarmyDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarmyDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarmyDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarmyDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarmyDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T11:00:57Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T11:00:57Z","body":"Hii, dropping in a suggestion for a change:\nI'd really like if the `[ExportGroup]` and/or but mainly classes in godot's inspector had the option to look like in these images below.\n\n| Type 1 - \"separation line\" | Type 2 - \"tab like\" |\n| :---: | :---: |\n| <img width=\"956\" height=\"676\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4898c00f-ae32-4dc2-99c5-2e33ebc8092a\" /> | <img width=\"956\" height=\"676\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b79467a-190e-4baa-a052-bc4ad2ccdd4f\" /> |\n\nI don't know if this is achievable with current theme, but would be really nice if the position of class name could be modified to align to `[Left | Center | Right]` as a setting.\nAnd also maybe have it be more 'tab-like'? You know, to better convey parts of the inspector.\n\nPersonally, I like the second look (Type 2) the most to be honest, \nThe aligning could be a bit more changed (lower the spacing inside class 'div')\nUnfortunately, I don't know how to modify the theme to make it look like that, I edited screenshots of godot on my phone\n\nI hope my suggestion will be warmly received","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567822638/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567847228","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112754#issuecomment-3567847228","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112754","id":3567847228,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UqQc8","user":{"login":"JuDelCo","id":1263262,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjMyNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1263262?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuDelCo","html_url":"https://github.com/JuDelCo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuDelCo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuDelCo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuDelCo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuDelCo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuDelCo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuDelCo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuDelCo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuDelCo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuDelCo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T11:26:35Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T11:26:35Z","body":"> I don't know if this is achievable with current theme, but would be really nice if the position of class name could be modified to align to `[Left | Center | Right]` as a setting. And also maybe have it be more 'tab-like'? You know, to better convey parts of the inspector.\n\nWithout a doubt, this design change makes it much easier to read and understand which properties belong to which node, without having to move my eyes horizontally so much to find the node titles. So +1 to the proposal !\n\n(I like type 2 too)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567847228/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568412254","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112754#issuecomment-3568412254","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112754","id":3568412254,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UsaZe","user":{"login":"NicholasBolen","id":98554429,"node_id":"U_kgDOBd_SPQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98554429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasBolen","html_url":"https://github.com/NicholasBolen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasBolen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasBolen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasBolen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasBolen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasBolen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasBolen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasBolen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicholasBole